# Whitelist exactly what ships. README imagery (media/readme/) rides GitHub
# raw URLs via vsce link rewriting, and media/icon.svg is only the PNG's
# source — neither belongs in the .vsix.
**
!dist/**
!media/icon.png
!media/strata.svg
!media/icons/**
!media/walkthrough/**
!package.json
!README.md
!CHANGELOG.md
!LICENSE
